      "in_game_acceptance": "PENDING_OWNER: at bind (age 0) the three spoke rings lie in one coplanar slab through the origin, so 10.6% of that capture is coplanar z-fight excluded under ruling 2 (3.1% at t_quarter, 0 elsewhere); above 0.5% (ruling 2026-09-02)",
